---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Artwork from '../../components/Artwork.astro';
---

<Base pageKey="service-website-redesign">
<main>
<section data-hero="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:110px 72px 90px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto">
  <div data-art-id="create-service-redesign" data-art="create-service-redesign" data-art-slot="" style="position:absolute;left:-60px;right:-60px;top:120px;height:420px;border-radius:0;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none"><Artwork id="create-service-redesign" />
    <div data-art-note="" data-art-label="" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(9,9,11,.82);border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.14);flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:520px">
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — WEBSITE REDESIGN</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717A">Artwork Placeholder</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">16:9 desktop · 3:2 tablet · 4:3 mobile · centred band</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3F46">Final artwork supplied separately</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:760px;">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Website redesign</div>
    <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.03">Keep what works. Rethink what doesn’t.</h1>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:600px">A redesign is a reassessment, not a repaint. We read the existing experience closely — what earns its place, what creates friction — then restructure around clearer content, current usability standards, responsive behaviour and where the business actually is now.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#52525B;max-width:600px">Content, URLs, integrations, analytics, domain configuration, hosting environment and search visibility are all reviewed before the redesign scope is confirmed.</p>
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:8px"><a href="/contact" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="5">Start a Project</a><a href="/pricing" data-route="pricing" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="6">Compare Website Packages</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;gap:70px;align-items:start">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">The problem</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">Nothing is broken. It has simply drifted.</h2></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Visual design that has aged, content bolted on a page at a time, a mobile experience nobody ever really designed, and pages slow enough to lose the visitor before the first sentence.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">The instinct is to start from zero, and that usually throws away value. Established content, existing search presence and recognisable brand elements are assets. The work is telling them apart from the rest.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px;padding:48px;border-radius:28px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
  <div data-row="" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:30px">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:640px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Our solution</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12">Read it honestly, then rebuild deliberately.</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">The audit covers structure, content, mobile behaviour, speed and conversion paths. From there the content architecture is reorganised and a current visual direction applied. Valuable pages, URLs and content are carried forward on purpose rather than by luck.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px 32px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Current-site audit</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Clearer positioning</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Content reorganization</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Modernised visual direction</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Improved usability</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Mobile experience rebuild</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Conversion path design</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Performance improvements</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Preservation of valuable content</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>URL and redirect planning</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Accessibility improvements</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Post-launch monitoring</span></div></div>
  
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">How the work runs</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em">A redesign runs on the same five stages, with an audit ahead of Discovery.</h2></div><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:16px"><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">01</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Audit</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">What works, what fails, what must be preserved.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">02</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Discovery</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Goals, audience and the new content structure.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">03</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Visual Direction</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">A modern direction proposed on real pages.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">04</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Design &amp; Build</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Rebuild, migrate content, redirects.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">05</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Launch</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">QA, redirects verified, publication and monitoring.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:40px;border-radius:26px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">What you get</div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;margin-top:4px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>A site that matches where the business is today</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Content a visitor can actually navigate</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>A mobile experience designed, not shrunk</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Faster pages and a healthier technical base</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Migration planning designed to reduce avoidable search disruption while preserving approved content and reviewing changes to URLs, structure, metadata, and platform technology. Search visibility cannot be guaranteed.</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Clear conversion paths on every page</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;padding:24px;border-radius:26px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
   <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A1A1AA">Before &amp; after</div>
   <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px"><div style="position:relative;height:200px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(120% 140% at 22% 12%,rgba(37,99,255,.14),rgba(9,9,11,0) 62%),#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.8;padding:0 16px">Before · current site</div></div><div style="position:relative;height:200px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(120% 140% at 22% 12%,rgba(37,99,255,.14),rgba(9,9,11,0) 62%),#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.8;padding:0 16px">After · redesign</div></div></div>
   <a href="/work/joan-leonardo" data-route="work-joan-leonardo" style="font-size:13px;color:#8B5CF6">Joan Leonardo &amp; Asociados case study →</a>
 </div></div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:44px;border-radius:26px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
   <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Scope and price</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12">Redesigns are quoted from the same website packages.</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px">The package depends on page count and functionality; the audit tells us which one fits. Sites with heavy content migration or custom functionality are quoted individually.</p></div>
   <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><a href="/contact?package=custom-website" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="5">Request a Redesign Quote</a><a href="/pricing" data-route="pricing" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="6">Compare Website Packages</a></div>
 </div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 90px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
  <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Migration, hosting and ownership</div>
  <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12;max-width:700px">What we review before the redesign scope is confirmed.</h2>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px">
    <div style="padding:32px 34px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
      <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Migration and search visibility</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">When page URLs, content, structure or platform technology change, Create Studio reviews the migration requirements and prepares the appropriate redirect and launch plan. Search visibility cannot be guaranteed.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;margin-top:4px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Existing-site, content and navigation audit</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Technical SEO and existing metadata review</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Redirect planning when URLs change</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Sitemap, analytics and Search Console continuity review</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Content and CMS migration when included</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Pre-launch quality assurance</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
      <div style="padding:32px 34px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
        <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Existing hosting and domains</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">If you already have an active hosting account, Create Studio will review the server, platform, access level, performance, compatibility and technical requirements before confirming whether it can support the redesigned website. A new hosting charge may not be required once an existing account is reviewed and confirmed suitable.</p>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">If new hosting is required, the account will be purchased and registered under your legal name. Create Studio may configure and manage the account, but you remain its owner. An existing domain must remain registered under your name — we may assist with DNS configuration and technical management but do not assume ownership.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:30px 32px;border-radius:22px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.28);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
  <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Client Ownership</h3>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Your domain and hosting account are registered under your name. You retain ownership and control of these digital assets, while Create Studio handles their approved setup and technical management.</p>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
